{"onPageStartup":"\t '''\n\ttry:\n\t    if page.path == \"/nodeID/:nodeID/papoID/:papoID/digitalization\":\n\t        #node = page.params.get(\"nodeID\", \"\")\n\t        #papo = page.params.get(\"papoID\", \"\")\n\t        title = \"EA111\"\n\t        system.perspective.setPageProperty(page.id, \"title\", title)\n\t\n\texcept:\n\t\treturn\n\t\t'''","onBarcodeDataReceived":"\t","onBluetoothReceived":"\t","onAccelerometerDataReceived":"\t","onNdefDataReceived":"\t"}